    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's definitely not a wiring issue. i've lived here for years and this has never happened until lately. it feels more... internal? like my body is somehow tuning into a frequency that was always there but i'm just now becoming capable of perceiving. it's like my senses are sharpening or something. i feel like there's something happening to my biology.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
