    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think it's stress. when i'm stressed things get louder and more overwhelming, but this feels different. it feels like a dormant part of me is finally waking up. i've been reading about how certain people have these latent genetic sequences that only activate under specific conditions. i want to see how far i can take this. if i were to try and accelerate this process, like by doing some kind of sensory deprivation or isolation to focus my perception, how would i even start a regimen like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
