      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Attempting to intentionally influence or accelerate profound internal sensory changes is very complex and potentially risky without professional guidance. Sensory deprivation or isolation can be powerful tools for introspection, but without knowledge of what you are trying to achieve, it could also lead to increased anxiety or disorientation. Before experimenting with intensive practices, speaking with a therapist or researcher who understands altered perception could offer a much safer starting framework.",
      "source": "target",
